Dear Landlord,

An update on the kitchen ceiling leak at 16 Brindlewick Mews. The contractor, Kellan Orve of Mossbarrow Pipe Services, attended today. He saw moisture at a compression joint above the kitchen ceiling access hatch while the tap was running. The hatch opening is too small to reach the joint safely, so a limited opening in the ceiling lining may be needed. No opening-up, drilling or repair has been done.

I have asked the contractor not to start any work and to send a full quote, including the opening, the repair and the total with VAT stated. I will send it to you as soon as it arrives and will wait for your approval before any work goes ahead. Our earlier request covered the inspection visit only.

Kind regards,
